# Copy to .env.local (or set in the host's environment) and fill in.
#
# Where the contact form posts consultation requests. Any service that accepts
# a JSON POST works - Formspree, Basin, a serverless function of your own.
# Leave it unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
#
# Read at build time, so it must be set wherever the production build runs.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
